      "statement": "dsh-pet-panel mounts into a DeepSeek Harness web profile as two halves that share nothing at runtime except the Typert remote contract: the host face (src/index.ts, emitted lib/index.js) runs in Node and registers six cordis plugins in a single apply(), while the browser face (src/client/index.ts, emitted lib/client.js) runs in the browser and applies slot components plus the /pet command.",
